@anneum Helm doesn't support upgrade of CRD's, so we should manually delete existing clusterpolicies CRD before install again. Also, currently operator doesn't support upgrade of already deployed components due to limitations with driver container, that it cannot restart on the fly and node reboot is required. We will add the upgrade support in future releases, meanwhile please follow these steps:

1. Uninstall existing CRD
2. **Install** Helm chart again with updated values instead of using `upgrade` command.

