@klueska I recall that due to the following [`runc` bug](https://github.com/opencontainers/runc/issues/2366#issue-609480075) we saw that long running containers would lose access to devices. Do you recall what our workaround was?

**Update**: The `runc` bug was triggered due to `CPUManager` issuing an update command for the container's CPU set every 10s irrespective as to whether changes were required. Our workaround was to patch CPUManager to only issue an update if something had changed. The changes have been [merged into upstream 1.22](https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/101771) but I am uncertain of the backport status.

